 "notes": "Episode 7 pack atlas, merged into bosses_battle. The White Phantom (bosses.png cell 6, 1x, not flipped) in three looks: white_phantom (Outer Frost, as painted), white_phantom_ward (The Frozen Ward: the cloak spread behind it like a door with an iron gate and three letters frozen into it, the crown frosted), white_phantom_thaw (Thawlight: the frost cracking off in plates, the crown dripping, a warm light in the chest). Each has _idle_1, _attack, _hurt, _cast, _die_0..2. The phases name their look: outer_frost -> white_phantom, frozen_ward -> white_phantom_ward, thawlight -> white_phantom_thaw (src/data/ep7/enemies.js; ai.js enterPhase forwards it as `sprite`). `hud`: one anchor per look, the same in all three (CRITIQUE_8 item 1): `crown` is the top of the antler crown above the skull as [dx, dy] from the bottom-centre origin (dy negative, up); `headPx` the crown and skull box [x0, x1, y0, y1] from the origin; `head` the same box as fractions of that look's frame (layout.js HEAD_BOX format)."
